        },
        {
          "text": "Lino Eliya waku-Tisibe mucisi ca-Gileadi wakaambila Ahabu kuti, Ncobeni mbwali muumi Jehova Leza wa-Israyeli, ngunjiiminide kubusyu bwakwe, takukooyooba imvula nuuba mume myaka ino cita nkaambe mebo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.1"
            ]
