                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova Leza wa-Israyeli. Cinkuli cabusu tacikooyoomana, ayalo insazi yamafuta taikooyooyuminina, mane kusikila kubuzuba obo Jehova mbwati wisye imvula anyika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
